    "Popular zones of Rio, keyed by zone, listing official neighborhood names (as in the IPP data).",
    "Derived from the official Planning Areas (AP): AP1 = Centro; AP2.1 = Zona Sul; AP2.2 (Grande Tijuca) and AP3 = Zona Norte; AP4 = Zona Sudoeste; AP5 = Zona Oeste.",
    "Zona Sudoeste was created by municipal law in Sep 2025 and covers the AP4 neighborhoods (Barra da Tijuca / Jacarepaguá region); Zona Oeste (2021 law) covers AP5.",
